LAME (MP3 export, optional)
---------------------------
MP3 export loads libmp3lame at runtime as a separate shared library; it is
never linked into AI-Track and can be replaced by the user. LAME is licensed
under the LGPL-2.0-or-later; source: https://lame.sourceforge.io/

